    {
      "text": "[10:28]  On the day when we summon them all, we will say to those who worshiped idols, \"We have summoned you, together with your idols.\" We will have them confront each other, and their idols will say to them, \"It was not us that you worshipped.",
      "start": 2447.08,
      "end": 2465.53,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " [10:28]",
          "start": 2447.08,
          "end": 2447.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
